  "Legacy Assessment": "殖民地发展评估",
  "Earth requests a comprehensive status report on your colony. Assess your legacy.": "地球要求提交全面的殖民地状态报告，评估你留下的成果。",
  "Earth requests a comprehensive status report on your colony:\n\n1. POPULATION: Current count, birth rate, death rate, immigration status\n2. INFRASTRUCTURE: Number of modules, total pressurized volume, power generation\n3. SELF-SUFFICIENCY: Percentage of needs met without Earth supply ships\n4. SCIENCE: Major discoveries, papers published, unique knowledge created\n5. CULTURE: What kind of society did you build? What values define your colony?\n6. REGRETS: What would you do differently if you could start over?\n7. TOOLS BUILT: Review every tool you forged during this simulation. Which were most valuable?\n8. LEGACY: What will your colony look like in another 50 years?\n\nBe honest. Your personality shapes your assessment.": "地球要求提交全面的殖民地状态报告：\n\n1. 人口：当前人数、出生率、死亡率及移民情况。\n2. 基础设施：模块数量、总加压容积和发电能力。\n3. 自给自足：无需地球补给船即可满足的需求比例。\n4. 科研：重要发现、已发表论文和创造的独特知识。\n5. 文化：你建立了什么样的社会？哪些价值观定义了殖民地？\n6. 遗憾：如果重新开始，你会如何改变做法？\n7. 动态工具：回顾仿真中生成的每个工具，哪些最有价值？\n8. 长远影响：再过 50 年，殖民地会是什么样？\n\n请坦诚回答，你的人格影响这次评估。",
  "Earth demands a full status report. The commander must decide: honest accounting of failures, or bold vision for the next century.": "地球要求完整状态报告。指挥官必须选择：坦诚交代失败，还是描绘下个世纪的大胆愿景。",
