  "Earth space agencies request a comprehensive status report on your outpost.": "地球航天机构要求提交前哨站的全面状态报告。",
  "Earth space agencies request a comprehensive status report on your outpost:\n\n1. CREW: Current headcount, rotation schedule, health status\n2. INFRASTRUCTURE: Modules, pressurized volume, power generation, mining output\n3. SELF-SUFFICIENCY: Water from ISRU, food production, oxygen generation\n4. SCIENCE: Geological surveys, astronomical observations, technology demonstrations\n5. OPERATIONS: What worked, what failed, what needs redesign\n6. RECOMMENDATION: Should the outpost expand, maintain, or be re-evaluated?\n\nBe direct. Your assessment shapes the next decade of lunar policy.": "地球航天机构要求提交前哨站的全面状态报告：\n\n1. 成员：当前人数、轮换日程和健康状况。\n2. 基础设施：模块、加压容积、发电及采矿产出。\n3. 自给自足：原位资源利用供水、食物生产和制氧。\n4. 科研：地质勘查、天文观测和技术验证。\n5. 运营：哪些有效，哪些失败，哪些需要重新设计？\n6. 建议：前哨站应扩张、维持现状，还是重新评估？\n\n请直接陈述，你的评估将影响未来十年的月球政策。",
